# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Larust — a Laravel-flavoured web framework for Rust
#
#  Root workspace .gitignore. Covers every member of the workspace:
#  crates/*, demo/, examples/. It blends Rust/Cargo conventions with the
#  Laravel application layout this framework scaffolds (env, storage,
#  database, compiled assets).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Rust / Cargo
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Cargo build artifacts (workspace root + any standalone crate/app build)
/target/
**/target/

# Cargo.lock is intentionally TRACKED, not ignored: the workspace ships binary
# targets (demo, examples/blog), and Cargo's guidance is to commit the lockfile
# for reproducible builds of applications. Do not add it to this file.

# rustfmt / editor backup files
*.rs.bk

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Laravel-style environment & secrets
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Runtime configuration, generated per-app (holds APP_KEY, DB creds, etc.)
.env
.env.local
.env.backup
.env.production
.env.*
!.env.example

# Encryption / signing / certificate keys
**/storage/*.key
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Larust application storage (mirrors Laravel's storage layout)
#  Generated cache/session/view/log content is ignored; the directory
#  skeleton is preserved via .gitkeep / .gitignore placeholders.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/storage/app/*
**/storage/framework/cache/*
**/storage/framework/sessions/*
**/storage/framework/views/*
**/storage/framework/testing/*
**/storage/logs/*
!**/storage/**/.gitkeep
!**/storage/**/.gitignore

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Frontend / compiled assets (Vite-style pipeline fed by resources/assets)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/public/build/
**/public/hot
**/public/storage

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Database
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/database/*.sqlite
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Editors / IDE
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.*/
*~

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  OS
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Logs / misc
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
plan.md
